# Uploaded menu photos. ImageStorageOptions.RootPath points here, so anything a developer
# uploads while running the API locally lands in the working tree. It is runtime data, not
# source: committing it would put one machine's test uploads into everyone's clone.
api/src/OrderingSystem.Api/wwwroot/media/
